## Integration acceptance

- Disconnect during a read, a configuration save and a device request, separately. Record how each reconciles after the native reconnect.
- Check that no action is replayed automatically, and that an unavailable entity does not claim an application-wide failure.
- Check safe and recovery mode clean-up, focus continuity and one announcement for each meaningful connection change.

Record what was tested using [Native task accessibility and evidence](native-task-accessibility.html). A source review or a local example is not a live check.

Wording follows [Keep unavailable, unknown, stale and offline apart](../content/writing-guidelines/states-and-errors.html#wg-033), [Give a recovery that matches the cause](../content/writing-guidelines/states-and-errors.html#wg-040), [Tell a mistake from a fault](../content/writing-guidelines/states-and-errors.html#wg-041) and [Explain pending and uncertain outcomes](../content/writing-guidelines/states-and-errors.html#wg-044).
